From: "HT9045 Machine (V906)" <Claude_RDBC_02@honprec.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 18:03:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-12: multi-select from the component tree (WPF
 document outline) (0.12.0)

- the tree allows Ctrl/Shift+click; a multi-selection there becomes the page's
  multi-selection (the clicked item is primary), so the align tools and group
  moves work from the outline too
- the page mirroring its selection into the tree no longer answers back
  (revealing flag), and a tree-originated multi-selection is kept by the probe

Tests: fake vscode 54 (click command + selection -> selectIds, clicked first),
real VS Code: selectIds from the tree keeps the multi-selection, align + one
undo; all layers pass, opened files byte-identical (MD5).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
